{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. If seen, move and process. Store and return to start.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorageLocation     /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInStorage     /> <Action ID = MoveToOriginalLocation     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectBeingHeld     /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject     />",
